<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .highlight {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            background-color: #0073e6;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: underline;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Reminder: Conflict of Interest (COI) Re-Declaration for Contract (@{triggerOutputs()?['body/sd99_contractnumber']})</p> -->

        <p>Dear Contract Manager,</p>

        <p>This is a reminder that the Conflict of Interest (COI) re-declaration for contract <strong>(@{triggerOutputs()?['body/sd99_contractnumber']})</strong> is due. 
        This process ensures compliance with NSW Corporate Commercial Policies, which require a yearly declaration for multi-year contracts.</p>

        <h3>Action Required:</h3>
        <ol>
            <li><strong>Review the Stakeholder List</strong> – Ensure all relevant parties are included and remove any outdated contacts.</li>
            <li><strong>Request Stakeholder Re-Declaration</strong> – Once the list is updated, request the re-declaration by clicking the 
                <strong>"Request Signature"</strong> button on the <strong>Manage Stakeholder</strong> page.</li>
        </ol>

        <!-- <p>You can access the contract record and update the stakeholder list under the <strong>Management</strong> tab:</p>
        <p><a href="@{variables('v_direct_link')}" class="button">Review Contract Record</a></p> -->

        <p>
            <a href="@{variables('v_direct_link')}"
                style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 15px; background-color: #0078D4; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline; border-radius: 5px;">
                Review Contract Record
            </a>
        </p>

        <h3>Important Note:</h3>
        <p>If you have already sent out the <strong>Declaration Request</strong>, you are receiving this email because at least one stakeholder 
        has not yet completed their declaration. Please follow up with the relevant contacts to ensure this process is finalized.</p>

        <p>Best regards,<br>
        <strong>GTP Commercial Team</strong></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
